      "song_duration_ms": 6556
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "Wring a rag. Wriggle a foot. Wrinkle a shirt. Wrestle a pal. Every one of them twists!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_079/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_079/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8411,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_079/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8463
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "Wrong means twisted, not right. A wry grin is twisted. A wreck is a twisted truck!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_079/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_079/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7993,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_079/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 9822
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "A wren is a bird. A wreath is a ring of twigs. Wrote, wrapper and wristband: that is nearly all the wr club!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_079/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_079/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 10213,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_079/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 12695
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "Write is odd: long ago it meant to scratch. At school you write with a wrist!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_079/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_079/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7470,
